{"id":"n62472-1-18","stage":3,"title":"주인공 · 主人公","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62472-1-18-1","ko":"그래서 결국 주인공은 어떻게 됐어?","zh":"那么，最终那个主角怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"“그러하여서(因为那样)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래서：“그러하여서(因为那样)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61170","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}},{"text":"결국","meaning":"最后，终于","explanation":"결국：最后，终于","readings":[{"term":"결국","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17260","senseId":"1","lemma":"결국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결국","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3"}},{"text":"주인공은","meaning":"主人公，主角","explanation":"주인공：主人公，主角；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주인공","audio":"/audio/4b72fe4264a8ed541f2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62472","senseId":"1","lemma":"주인공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주인공은","audio":"/audio/1316f51f961e08136705.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"됐어?","meaning":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","explanation":"되다：发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐어","audio":"/audio/9b5be22a79f473c72762.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"“그러하여서(因为那样)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61170","definition":"“그러하여서(因为那样)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a1a5375588e265b0","term":"결국","zh":"最后，终于","audio":"/audio/a1a5375588e265b035a5.mp3","entryId":"17260","definition":"作为事情的结果。","pronunciation":["결국"]},{"id":"4b72fe4264a8ed54","term":"주인공","zh":"主人公，主角","audio":"/audio/4b72fe4264a8ed541f2c.mp3","entryId":"62472","definition":"在话剧、电影、小说等里成为故事核心的人物。","pronunciation":["주인공"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9ef5a49417d1217cf93.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62472-1-18-2","ko":"나도 끝까지 영화를 보진 못했지만 아마 끝까지 살아남았을 거야.","zh":"我也没看到电影的最后，不过他应该活下来了吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"끝까지","meaning":"完，到头，最后","explanation":"끝：完，到头，最后；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"끝","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48072","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝까지","audio":"/audio/cc46b687300632479286.mp3"}},{"text":"영화를","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화를","audio":"/audio/dede45f73452f5a077ee.mp3"}},{"text":"보진","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보진","audio":"/audio/74da65b17a20369cb1d0.mp3"}},{"text":"못했지만","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못했지만","audio":"/audio/b5051dcba651ca167a93.mp3"}},{"text":"아마","meaning":"也许","explanation":"아마：也许","readings":[{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71248","senseId":"1","lemma":"아마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아마","audio":"/audio/2a38de25ef5f5194f0a9.mp3"}},{"text":"끝까지","meaning":"完，到头，最后","explanation":"끝：完，到头，最后；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"끝","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48072","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝까지","audio":"/audio/cc46b687300632479286.mp3"}},{"text":"살아남았을","meaning":"幸存，存活","explanation":"살아남다：幸存，存活；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"살아남다","audio":"/audio/04bb9f1e8836e228f28d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16737","senseId":"1","lemma":"살아남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아남았을","audio":"/audio/5a1e9f8b6b3014e14178.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","